IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://architecturehousto
 n.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/AIA_Approved_CE_horiz_2c-1200x494-4e6c487
 .jpg
