	obile pay (such as Apple Pay or Google Pay). Will call tickets can be pick
	ed up on day of show at the Box Office. Box Office opens 1 hour prior to d
	oor times. You will need a valid photo ID and the credit card used for pur
	chase. ADA tickets can be purchased online - you do not need to call the b
